ontology_system.user_template:
Current ontology structure:
{ontology_context}

Analyze these tags and suggest relationships:
{tags}

Output your suggestions as JSON with the following structure:
{{
    "synonyms": [
        {{"concept": "existing_concept_tag", "synonym": "new_synonym"}}
    ],
    "hierarchies": [
        {{"child": "child_tag", "parent": "parent_tag"}}
    ],
    "same_as": [
        {{"canonical": "main_tag", "alternatives": ["alt1", "alt2"]}}
    ],
    "reasoning": "Brief explanation of your suggestions"
}}

Guidelines:
1. For synonyms: Identify different ways to express the same concept
2. For hierarchies: Place specific concepts under more general ones
3. For same_as: Group variations of the same term (abbreviations, full names, etc.)
4. Consider the AI/tech domain context
5. Maintain consistency with existing ontology

